### Create player profile
POST http://localhost:8086/profiles
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "accountId": "c37779b3-712c-4d21-bf36-a188793261b4",
  "fullName": "Test Player",
  "dateOfBirth": "1999-04-15",
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "email": "test.player@example.com",
  "phone": "+3725000100",
  "address": "Tallinn",
  "language": "en",
  "currency": "EUR"
}

### Get player profile by id (integer PK — use 1 or 2 for seeded data)
GET http://localhost:8086/profiles/1

### Update player profile
PUT http://localhost:8086/profiles/1
content-type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "acc-01",
  "fullName": "Test Player Updated",
  "dateOfBirth": "1999-04-15",
  "status": "INACTIVE",
  "email": "updated.player@example.com",
  "phone": "+3725000100",
  "address": "Tartu",
  "language": "et",
  "currency": "EUR"
}

### Update contact details
PATCH http://localhost:8086/profiles/1/contact
content-type: application/json

{
  "email": "contact.only@example.com",
  "phone": "+3725000757",
  "address": "Parnuuuuu"
}

### Update preferences
PATCH http://localhost:8086/profiles/1/preferences
content-type: application/json

{
  "language": "en",
  "currency": "USD"
}

